B.PR=new A.a1(B.mW,[u.W,"Tokens",u.gZ,"Theme Tokens","Radius Scale",u.eQ,"Presets",u.dR,"Component Themes",u.n,"Sizing and density",u.bC,"Glass Surfaces",u.aE,"Animated Theming",u.F,"Motion",u.bv,u.O,"How It Works",u.cY,u.s,"Setting the Mode","Pass a theme per brightness and a ",u.o,"Toggling the Mode",u.Y,"Following the System",u.dE," in the header. Use the same pattern.",u.a0,u.fW,"Language Switcher",u.dQ,"RTL Example",u.Z,"Per-Instance Override",u.c3,"Installing a Locale","The offline installer writes the locale wiring into your project \u2014 no pasting, no network. Each component records the strings it reads, including those of the components it depends on, so installing a component installs its translations too: component installs the English base and the strings one component needs for every locale the project already has; add installs a language for every component already in the project, and components added later receive it automatically. Running either command again changes nothing.","Wire the generated file into DashcnApp once; every component below it re-strings. The public API is backward compatible: ComponentLocalizations is still the lookup, DashcnLocalizations is its alias.",u.el,u.d2,"Metrics",u.D,"How it is produced",u.cJ,"Limits",u.u,"All components",u.eX],t.w)
